        "created_at": "2022-03-25T00:06:41.022Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You must be insanely good at this game if you literally always win on the first try.  Has the game become less fun for you as a result of being THAT efficient at beating it?  Personally I find that losing sometimes is part of the joy of winning other times; I often wish certain matches (not the last couple, but several of those before them) were a bit harder than they are.</p>",
