        "id": 243864,
        "name": "MigrantP",
        "username": "MigrantP",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-03-25T01:51:39.866Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m pretty good at the game, but I don’t always win on the first try. If I don’t, I try again (or again) or change up the decks.</p>\n<p>Generally I don’t think it’s fair to post a one-shot that I didn’t win on the first try, because there’s an off chance that the deck ordering made the game actually unwinnable (or near enough).</p>\n<p>I play Sentinels every week on the tabletop and often on digital. Hasn’t become less fun yet!</p>",
